    wowFact: 'Feynman built this entire framework from a single cryptic sentence in a 1933 paper by Paul Dirac, which hinted at a connection between quantum mechanics and the classical principle of least action. Where Dirac wrote that a certain quantity "corresponds to" something, Feynman interpreted this literally and constructed a complete reformulation of quantum mechanics from that single hint.',
